{"seq":1,"slug":"what-are-vlms","title":"什么是 VLM","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/vision-language-models/foundations/what-are-vlms","wordCount":1758,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"什么是-vlm\">什么是 VLM</h1><p>打开 2026 年的任意一个前沿聊天助手，把一张发票拍照上传，它能直接读出金额、判断科目、算出税额——这背后不是先跑一个 OCR 再把文字塞给语言模型的流水线，而是一个端到端的视觉语言模型（VLM）。VLM 把「看图」与「说话」融进同一个可微系统：图像不再是被预处理成文字的外部输入，而是和文本 token 平起平坐、共同进入语言模型注意力计算的一等公民。理解 VLM 的第一步，是看清它由哪三个部件组成、这三个部件如何分工，以及它和「会看图的分类器」「会说话的 LLM」到底差在哪里。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-三段式解剖\">核心概念：三段式解剖</h2><p>主流 VLM 遵循一个高度一致的三段式结构：<strong>视觉编码器</strong>把图像变成一串视觉特征，**连接器（connector / projector）**把这些特征投影到语言模型的 token 嵌入空间，<strong>语言模型主干</strong>把投影后的视觉 token 和文本 token 拼成一个序列做自回归生成。LLaVA-1.5 是这套范式的教科书式样本：CLIP 的 ViT-L/14 编码器对一张 336×336 图像产出 576 个视觉特征，一个两层 MLP 把它们映射成 576 个视觉 token，接到 Vicuna 语言模型上一起解码。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  IMG[输入图像] --&gt; ENC[视觉编码器&lt;br/&gt;CLIP / SigLIP ViT]&#10;  ENC --&gt; FEAT[视觉特征&lt;br/&gt;576 个 patch 向量]&#10;  FEAT --&gt; CONN[连接器&lt;br/&gt;MLP / Q-Former / 交叉注意力]&#10;  CONN --&gt; VTOK[视觉 token&lt;br/&gt;嵌入到 LLM 空间]&#10;  TXT[文本提示] --&gt; TTOK[文本 token]&#10;  VTOK --&gt; SEQ[拼接序列]&#10;  TTOK --&gt; SEQ&#10;  SEQ --&gt; LLM[语言模型主干&lt;br/&gt;自回归解码]&#10;  LLM --&gt; OUT[文本输出]\">flowchart TD\n  IMG[输入图像] --&gt; ENC[视觉编码器&lt;br/&gt;CLIP / SigLIP ViT]\n  ENC --&gt; FEAT[视觉特征&lt;br/&gt;576 个 patch 向量]\n  FEAT --&gt; CONN[连接器&lt;br/&gt;MLP / Q-Former / 交叉注意力]\n  CONN --&gt; VTOK[视觉 token&lt;br/&gt;嵌入到 LLM 空间]\n  TXT[文本提示] --&gt; TTOK[文本 token]\n  VTOK --&gt; SEQ[拼接序列]\n  TTOK --&gt; SEQ\n  SEQ --&gt; LLM[语言模型主干&lt;br/&gt;自回归解码]\n  LLM --&gt; OUT[文本输出]</pre><p>这套结构的精妙之处在于：语言模型几乎不需要改造，它本来就在做「给定一串 token 预测下一个 token」，连接器只要把视觉信息伪装成「一种特殊的 token」，LLM 就能用它已有的推理能力消费图像。三个部件里，编码器是「眼睛」，主干是「大脑」，连接器是把眼睛接到大脑上的那根视神经——而这根视神经为何如此难连，正是 <a href=\"modality-alignment\">模态对齐挑战</a> 一篇的主题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"谱系-从对比学习到原生多模态\">谱系：从对比学习到原生多模态</h2><p>VLM 不是一夜之间出现的，它有清晰的代际演进，每一代都换了「视觉与语言如何耦合」的思路。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>代际</th>\n<th>代表</th>\n<th>耦合方式</th>\n<th>视觉与语言的关系</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>双塔对比（2021）</td>\n<td>CLIP、ALIGN</td>\n<td>两个独立编码器，对比损失对齐</td>\n<td>各编对方一个全局向量，不生成文本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>桥接生成（2022）</td>\n<td>BLIP-2、Flamingo</td>\n<td>Q-Former / 交叉注意力桥接冻结 LLM</td>\n<td>视觉作为前缀注入冻结的 LLM</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>投影对齐（2023–2024）</td>\n<td>LLaVA、Qwen2.5-VL</td>\n<td>MLP 投影 + 视觉指令微调</td>\n<td>LLM 为主干，视觉是可训练的适配器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>原生多模态（2025–2026）</td>\n<td>部分前沿模型</td>\n<td>单一 Transformer 从零混合模态训练</td>\n<td>不再有桥，视觉与文本同源训练</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>CLIP 那一代严格说不是 VLM——它只会判断「图文是否匹配」，不会生成句子，但它训练出的视觉编码器至今仍是绝大多数 VLM 的眼睛，这条渊源在 <a href=\"vision-encoders\">视觉编码器</a> 里细讲。真正让模型「看图说话」的是后三代：BLIP-2 用 Q-Former 桥接冻结的 LLM，LLaVA 用最简单的 MLP 加视觉指令微调把效果做到惊人地好，而 2025–2026 的最新一代干脆抛弃「先有 LLM 再外挂视觉」的思路，让单个 Transformer 从一开始就在混合模态数据上训练。</p>\n<h2 id=\"vlm-不是什么-三条分界线\">VLM 不是什么：三条分界线</h2><p>初学者最容易把 VLM 和三类相邻系统混淆，划清边界能省去很多误解。</p>\n<p>第一，VLM <strong>不是图像分类器加文本模板</strong>。分类器输出固定标签集合里的一个类，而 VLM 输出开放词表的自由文本，能回答「这张图里那个人为什么在笑」这种没有预设标签的问题。第二，VLM <strong>不是 OCR 流水线</strong>。流水线是「图→文字→LLM」的串行管线，中间的文字是信息瓶颈，图里的版式、颜色、空间关系一旦没被 OCR 提取就永久丢失；VLM 让 LLM 直接注意到 patch 级视觉特征，版式与空间信息得以保留。第三，VLM <strong>不是文生图模型</strong>。文生图（如扩散模型）是「文本→图像」的生成方向，而 VLM 是「图像→文本」的理解方向，二者方向相反、目标相反，这条边界在生成式 AI 那边讲得更细。</p>\n<p>值得强调的是第二条：正因为视觉信息以 token 形式直接进入注意力，一张图该被编码成多少个视觉 token、信息如何压缩，就成了一个核心的工程权衡——这是 <a href=\"../architecture/visual-tokenization\">视觉 token 化</a> 要解决的问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"一个最小可用-vlm-的数据流\">一个最小可用 VLM 的数据流</h2><p>把三段式结构落到代码层面，一次前向推理的数据流可以这样描述。给定图像张量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">R</mi><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>W</mi><mo>×</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I \\in \\mathbb{R}^{H \\times W \\times 3}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8413em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbb\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8413em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">×</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">×</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，视觉编码器 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>v</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 产出特征序列 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>v</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>I</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">R</mi><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>v</mi></msub></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V = f_v(I) \\in \\mathbb{R}^{N \\times d_v}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbb\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">×</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1645em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 是视觉 token 数、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>v</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是编码器维度。连接器 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span>（最简形式是 MLP）把它投影到语言模型维度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>l</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_l</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>V</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">R</mi><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>l</mi></msub></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Z = g(V) \\in \\mathbb{R}^{N \\times d_l}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">Z</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbb\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">×</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3488em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1512em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。文本提示经过词嵌入得到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">R</mi><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>l</mi></msub></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T \\in \\mathbb{R}^{M \\times d_l}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbb\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">×</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3488em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1512em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，两者沿序列维拼接成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>Z</mi><mo separator=\"true\">;</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[Z; T]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">Z</span><span class=\"mpunct\">;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 送入 LLM，按标准自回归目标 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">L</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>t</mi></msub><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>∣</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>Z</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{L} = -\\sum_t \\log p(y_t \\mid y_{&lt;t}, Z, T)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0497em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1308em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mrel mtight\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1774em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">Z</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 训练或解码。</p>\n<p>关键洞察是：这个损失函数和纯文本 LLM 的训练损失一模一样，唯一的改动是把视觉 token <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Z</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">Z</span></span></span></span></span> 作为条件前缀加了进去。这意味着 VLM 训练能复用 LLM 成熟的全部基础设施，也意味着 VLM 的能力上限被它的语言模型主干和那条「视神经」共同决定。各部件的可训练性（编码器冻不冻、连接器怎么训、主干微调与否）构成了不同的训练配方，详见 <a href=\"../training/vlm-pretraining\">VLM 预训练</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>VLM 是把视觉编码器、连接器、语言模型主干缝成单一可微系统的范式，让图像以「视觉 token」形式与文本平等进入 LLM 的注意力计算。</li>\n<li>三个部件分别是眼睛、视神经、大脑；连接器这根视神经为何难连，是模态对齐难题，也是后续架构章的主线。</li>\n<li>VLM 谱系经历了双塔对比、桥接生成、投影对齐、原生多模态四代，但 CLIP 式视觉编码器至今仍是大多数 VLM 的眼睛。</li>\n<li>VLM 区别于图像分类器（开放文本 vs 固定标签）、OCR 流水线（端到端 vs 串行瓶颈）、文生图模型（理解方向 vs 生成方向）。</li>\n<li>VLM 的训练损失与纯文本 LLM 几乎相同，唯一区别是把视觉 token 作为条件前缀，这让它能复用 LLM 的全部基础设施。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读-跨库链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨库链接</h2><ul>\n<li>同 hub：<a href=\"vision-encoders\">视觉编码器</a>、<a href=\"modality-alignment\">模态对齐挑战</a>、<a href=\"../architecture/connector-architectures\">连接器架构</a></li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../../multimodal-ai/vision-language-models/clip-and-contrastive\">CLIP 与对比学习</a>（多模态 AI hub，VLM 编码器的对比学习源头）</li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../../computer-vision/image-fundamentals/digital-image-representation\">数字图像表示</a>（计算机视觉 hub，图像作为张量的底层表示）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>来源：LLaVA-1.5 架构（labelyourdata.com VLM 2026 指南、CVPR 2024 Improved Baselines）、VLM 代际演进（promptquorum.com Local Vision Models 2026）。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"什么是 VLM","id":"什么是-vlm"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：三段式解剖","id":"核心概念-三段式解剖"},{"level":2,"text":"谱系：从对比学习到原生多模态","id":"谱系-从对比学习到原生多模态"},{"level":2,"text":"VLM 不是什么：三条分界线","id":"vlm-不是什么-三条分界线"},{"level":2,"text":"一个最小可用 VLM 的数据流","id":"一个最小可用-vlm-的数据流"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨库链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨库链接"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"视觉编码器","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/vision-language-models/foundations/vision-encoders"}}